-- R2 third repair handoff: the full check of the 1,119 remaining Official template statement-pair items.
-- 142 key fixes, 1 learner-copy key fix and 43 deletes. OWNER RUNS THIS. Claude has not run it and will not.
-- Source: docs/claude-findings/2026-10-19-v0175-r2-statement-pair-answer-key-scan.md (owner decision 3).
-- Independent of handoffs 1 and 2; any order works.
--
-- Method: Codex judged all 1,119 (221 wrong, 8 ambiguous). Fresh cold Opus agents, blind to Codex's verdicts,
-- re-checked all 229 flags: 185 wrong, and 44 left as keyed. A blind Opus check of 60 random Codex passes
-- found 0 wrong keys.
-- Key fixes: wrong key, explanation supports the correct answer; only correctIndex changes (correctIndices is
-- an empty array on these rows; QuizItem.resolveCorrectIndex takes a valid correctIndex first). Guarded:
-- a row changes only if its current key is still the one that was checked.
-- Deletes: wrong key and the explanation is also wrong or argues for the wrong key. ADMIN-owned rows only,
-- unclaimed only. No foreign key references challenge_quiz_question_bank.
--
-- EXPECTED: step 1 returns fix found 142 / will_change 142, delete found 43 / deletable 43 / learner_copies 0,
-- and learner_fix found 1 / will_change 1. Step 2 reports UPDATE 142, DELETE 43 and UPDATE 1. Anything else: ROLLBACK and send the output back.

